{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pulls/497","id":5330600046,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU6rh8s8AAAABPbqAbg","html_url":"https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pull/497","diff_url":"https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pull/497.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pull/497.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/issues/497","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pulls/497/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pulls/497/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/issues/497/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/statuses/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c","number":497,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Validate Windows launcher installation before publication","user":{"login":"Jacob-J-Thomas","id":92639671,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYWRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92639671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas","html_url":"https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob-J-Thomas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #436. Owner acceptance on #276/#325 remains separate.\n\nThe installer previously wrote final files before validating all inputs; `-NoShortcuts` skipped validation, and a source PWA shortcut could be overwritten through a path alias. The installer now validates and stages the complete candidate before publication, refuses physical source/output collisions, gives actionable supported-Node guidance, and restores verified originals after publication failure. Uncertain recovery artifacts are retained for diagnosis.\n\nPrivate `--validate-install` and `--stage-shortcut` commands require fully qualified Windows paths and run before launcher side effects. Staged shortcuts contain their final target, config, icon and AppUserModelID. Public PowerShell relative-path behavior is preserved. The change adds bounded child calls, same-volume staging, file-identity checks and permanent Windows PowerShell 5.1 regressions.\n\nFinal publication head: `2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c`; target: `be633141be5a0cd2b4f960a46761fabbf2cb82c7`. The six product/test/document inputs are unchanged from corrected product `a73b9a887c50f51d4fc4af54aa806fda42e31abf`. The temporary QA workflow has been removed; the ordinary workflow is byte-identical to the target. [Final ordinary CI run](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/actions/runs/43829142179) is in progress against verified synthetic merge `80c581ebc95de2000c25ed2b5995d5a648fa95ba`, tree `d064706fb48def7bacac5e434f96825c5850d214`.\n\nValidation:\n\n- [Old-source baseline](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-validation-baseline/README.md): 32 cases reproduced 22 differences, including 17 invalid-input final-file mutations and eight invalid successes.\n- [Focused implementation checks](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-validation-implementation/README.md) and [independent actual Opus behavior QA](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-private-cli-corrected/README.md): the private-path correction passed 29 cases and 384 checks, with all actual child exit/close receipts retained. Inert executable fixtures provide component evidence.\n- [First hosted candidate](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-validation-candidate-first-failure/README.md): 31/32 criteria passed; omitted Node discovery under caller StrictMode returned a raw property error. The [narrow correction and permanent regression](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-node-discovery-correction/README.md) preserve that failure and now cover missing and valid default discovery.\n- [Corrected hosted QA](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-validation-candidate-corrected/README.md): all 32 cases passed (four supported routes, 28 refusals), with unchanged refused bytes/native identities. All 49 direct process receipts and 399 traced lifetimes matched; no gateway/Chrome start or trace loss was observed. A separate actual PowerShell 5.1 public seed and composed production publisher recorded three real replacements followed by Windows sharing error `0x80070020`, then restored all six original artifacts and native metadata. Root independently verified both ZIPs, every member and the raw lifetime analysis.\n- [First carrier CI](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-candidate-other-ci/README.md) and [corrected carrier CI](https://github.com/Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin/blob/2732dd34457bcd9a7007e89c3fa11fe085af764c/docs/qa/2026-11-16-installer-corrected-other-ci/README.md) preserve the Gates 30-minute deadline failures. Browser and Template image passed both; final licence/docs/contrast/audit checks were skipped. The corrected attempt emitted only ten of thirteen coverage groups. These attempts do not satisfy the final CI gate.\n\nQualifications: matrix PowerShell 7 versus the permanent/public-seed PowerShell 5.1 checks; real image Chrome proxy with synthetic profile; composed rollback rather than timed public-installer interruption; no owner UI acceptance. The initial offline count of 396 lifetimes and its birth-bounded correction to 399 are both retained, with the PartitionInfo decode warning. No native rerun was needed for that offline correction. Prior unrelated native refusal and coverage-deadline findings remain #471/#488.\n\nDelivery: GPT-6.1 Sol xhigh implementation, narrow GPT-6 Luna xhigh corrections, separate GPT-6.1 Sol native QA and actual Claude Code Opus 5.5 xhigh behavior QA. After every final CI job passes, actual Opus performs formal opposite-family review and a fresh Astra max session performs the final exact-head/target audit. Formal scans: 0/3. The draft remains unmerged; held PR #460 and subsequent #438/#456 retain their gates.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-16T03:38:22Z","updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:11:52Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"80c581ebc95de2000c25ed2b5995d5a648fa95ba","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Jacob-J-Thomas:codex/gg-20261116-installer-validation","ref":"codex/gg-20261116-installer-validation","repo":{"id":1403707890,"node_id":"R_kgDOU6rh8g","name":"GraphGoblin","full_name":"Jacob-J-Thomas/GraphGoblin","owner":{"login":"Jacob-J-Thomas","id":92639671,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYWRtw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92639671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jacob